{"id":"wb-6-374","name":"西李门二仙庙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"西李门二仙庙","text":"西李门二仙庙位于中国山西省高平市河西镇西李门村，2006年被列为第六批全国重点文物保护单位。\n西李门二仙庙始建于唐，金正隆二年（1157年）、大定二年（1162年）大修，明清均有修葺。整体建筑坐北朝南，两进院落，占地2748平方米，现存山门、中殿、后殿、东西配殿和廊庑等建筑，其中中殿为金正隆二年所建，余为明清所建。中殿面阔三间，进深六椽，单檐歇山顶，梁架结构为四椽栿对前乳栿通檐用三柱。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%A5%BF%E6%9D%8E%E9%97%A8%E4%BA%8C%E4%BB%99%E5%BA%99","revisionId":94410072,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94410072","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/899e7ab1484829dba00b8eba.jpg","title":"20260828_Xilimen_Erxian_Temple_03.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20260828_Xilimen_Erxian_Temple_03.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/03/20260828_Xilimen_Erxian_Temple_03.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​全国重点文物保护单位 山西高平 西李门二仙庙 中殿","width":320,"height":213}}